WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.049 --> 00:00:05.940
The one piece manga finally showed us the
strongest crew in one piece history as the

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:11.840
Rocks crew takes the stage for the very first
time in the story on God Valley at the same

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:15.679
time as a young Roger with Luffy’s straw
hat!

00:00:15.679 --> 00:00:21.590
And just wow, after so many years of talking
about this legendary pirate crew, we are finally

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:23.860
seeing them all together here at God Valley.

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:29.660
And even though Oda is still teasing us by
not showing Rocks D. Xebec’s full appearance,

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:36.250
it is still amazing to see all of the insane
members of this crew, including some we didn’t

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:37.250
expect.

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:42.860
But before we get into all the new reveals,
it seems like the Rocks’ true objective

00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:48.230
was to obtain these crazy devil fruits that
the Celestial Dragons are offering as prizes

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:50.820
for the tournament.

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:56.969
We can tell because we see Big Mom almost
immediately go after the devil fruits, and

00:00:56.969 --> 00:01:02.200
capture what will later be Kaido’s fruit,
but it is also super interesting to think

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:05.700
about what other fruits could be in these
treasure chests.

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:10.470
Of course, we know Kuma’s fruit was another
of the six, but what about the other four?

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:17.630
There are a few real possibilities here based
on other characters that are here at God Valley.

00:01:17.630 --> 00:01:23.680
For example, we never knew for sure when Whitebeard
ate his Tremor fruit, so I could very easily

00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:28.439
imagine that Whitebeard got his devil fruit
from one of these prize chests.

00:01:28.439 --> 00:01:31.580
Another logical possibility is the Float Float
fruit.

00:01:31.580 --> 00:01:39.980
Because in case you forgot, the Golden Lion
Shiki is here and at some time he ate this

00:01:39.980 --> 00:01:45.750
devil fruit which allows him to make anything
float in the air, including himself.

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:53.250
Another random but super exciting option is
some sort of wind or weather devil fruit because

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:58.630
while Luffy’s father, Monkey D. Dragon,
has not shown up yet, I do wonder if his wind

00:01:58.630 --> 00:02:05.700
related powers could be related to one of
the devil fruits in the chests.

00:02:05.700 --> 00:02:11.280
On top of all that, one fruit that I saw people
speculating about is the Nika fruit, but honestly

00:02:11.280 --> 00:02:16.110
I don’t think the Nika fruit is that strong
of a possibility since the Gorosei always

00:02:16.110 --> 00:02:20.319
wanted to get their hands on it, but never
seemed to be able to.

00:02:20.319 --> 00:02:27.890
I even think it is possible the Rocks already
ate the Nika fruit, since he was able to bring

00:02:27.890 --> 00:02:32.180
together such a stupidly powerful crew similar
to Luffy.

00:02:32.180 --> 00:02:36.819
But even if that’s not the case, another
likely option for one of the treasure chests

00:02:36.819 --> 00:02:42.350
is the Darkness fruit, which just makes perfect
sense to be one of the prizes here.

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:47.270
I mean it is the ultimate Logia devil fruit,
and I’ve even made a theory in the past

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:50.130
that Rocks was after the Darkness fruit.

00:02:50.130 --> 00:02:55.460
Plus if you want even more evidence, we already
know that Blackbeard was greatly influenced

00:02:55.460 --> 00:02:59.920
by Rocks, with his ship name and his goal
to rule the world, so wouldn’t it make sense

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:04.799
that Rocks wanted the darkness fruit, but
was somehow stopped from eating it, which

00:03:04.799 --> 00:03:08.050
left Blackbeard to fulfill that desire later
on?

00:03:08.050 --> 00:03:11.379
It makes sense to me at least.

00:03:11.379 --> 00:03:16.280
But if the devil fruits weren’t Rocks’
true goal, then what was?

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:23.909
Well, by looking at his main goal of taking
over the world, a pretty easy answer would

00:03:23.909 --> 00:03:28.569
be that he just wanted to come and wipe out
all the world nobles.

00:03:28.569 --> 00:03:31.030
Which, honestly, yes, please do.

00:03:31.030 --> 00:03:36.650
The world would be much better off without
them, but if that was his real goal, then

00:03:36.650 --> 00:03:41.171
we have to ask once again, why would Roger
stop him?

00:03:41.171 --> 00:03:50.360
In fact, they have a short, but pretty interesting
exchange in this chapter where Roger tells

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:55.159
Rocks to stop, but then Rocks tells Roger
to stay out of his way.

00:03:55.159 --> 00:04:02.050
Which isn’t a lot, but it clearly shows
that Roger knew what Rocks was doing and didn’t

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:03.050
like it.

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:07.750
And since we know Roger was a good guy, it
is kinda hard to believe that Rocks was doing

00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:11.270
anything positive like wanting to free the
slaves.

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:18.720
And while that’s basically all we got from
those two legends, the reveal of Rocks’

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:22.790
crew gave us some SHOCKING new information.

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:34.070
Because out of all the people in the world,
who would have expected that ELDER NYON, who

00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:40.040
was the Empress of Amazon Lily a few generations
ago, was actually a part of this world-conquering

00:04:40.040 --> 00:04:41.410
crew?

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:44.220
Like seriously, what is she doing here???

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:49.930
She never gave off any powerful vibes when
she let Boa Hancock literally throw her out

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:55.190
of a window, so did she have some other role
or purpose on the crew?

00:04:55.190 --> 00:05:01.650
It’s pretty easy to imagine that she was
actually in love with someone since that is

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:08.880
a common theme for the Empresses, but was
it Rocks or someone else on the crew?

00:05:08.880 --> 00:05:13.960
And while we’re talking about former Empresses,
this actually makes me wonder if all the former

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:18.169
Empresses fell in love with powerful pirates.

00:05:18.169 --> 00:05:21.740
For example, Elder Nyon possibly loved someone
on Rocks’ crew.

00:05:21.740 --> 00:05:25.200
Shakky here fell in love with Rogers’ right
hand man, Rayleigh.

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:30.410
Boa of course is head over heels for Luffy,
and there is actually one more Empress before

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:32.970
Boa that we aren’t currently aware of.

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:42.569
But now I’m actually wondering if it could
be someone like Makino was this missing Empress

00:05:42.569 --> 00:05:46.229
who seems to be in a relationship with Shanks.

00:05:46.229 --> 00:05:52.069
Which I know sounds crazy, but who else fits
with the timeline and is in love with a super

00:05:52.069 --> 00:05:53.620
strong pirate?

00:05:53.620 --> 00:06:00.020
Anyway, we also got to see the young appearance
of Miss Buckingham, who not surprisingly looks

00:06:00.020 --> 00:06:02.199
exactly like her clone, Stussy.

00:06:02.199 --> 00:06:07.190
Which is always funny to me how some characters
somehow shrink and get super wrinkly with

00:06:07.190 --> 00:06:08.190
age.

00:06:08.190 --> 00:06:13.780
But she definitely has something going on
with Whitebeard as we even see her sitting

00:06:13.780 --> 00:06:15.870
on his shoulders.

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:22.280
So maybe they really did get it on and this
guy really is Whitebeard’s son.

00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:29.180
Then we have one more member who is either
Silver Ax or Wang Zhi, and they look somewhat

00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:30.610
like Kaido does.

00:06:30.610 --> 00:06:36.120
There’s also John, who we see chugging down
some booze just like we saw his zombie in

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:37.120
Thriller Bark.

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:42.470
Of course, we also have Shiki, who looks as
he did before chopping off his legs in Impel

00:06:42.470 --> 00:06:43.470
Down.

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:46.990
And man, I’m still really wishing we got
to see Rocks because I’m actually kinda

00:06:46.990 --> 00:06:56.090
worried we aren’t going to come back to
God Valley for quite some time.

00:06:56.090 --> 00:07:02.069
But before we get more into the future, we
of course have to discuss this young chad,

00:07:02.069 --> 00:07:05.259
Roger, in all his full Straw Hat glory.

00:07:05.259 --> 00:07:11.360
Man, I’m getting goosebumps just seeing
him like this.

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:18.039
And joining the fight with him we have his
right hand, Rayleigh, as well as his other

00:07:18.039 --> 00:07:21.949
top commander, Scopper Gaban, along with his
other crew members.

00:07:21.949 --> 00:07:27.460
And wow, I’m just so excited to finally
see them in their prime.

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:32.610
Clearly, they are going to oppose Rocks and
his crew, but what else is going to happen

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:33.610
here?

00:07:33.610 --> 00:07:41.470
I 
think it is pretty likely the Holy Knights

00:07:41.470 --> 00:07:46.440
join in the battle as well, and we even met
a few more of them in this chapter.

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:51.570
Like this one who looks like some kind of
royalty, this young woman, this gas mask wearing

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:58.570
dude, plus a younger looking girl with a hat
covering her eyes.

00:07:58.570 --> 00:08:03.020
Which means we have to ask just how strong
are these fighters?

00:08:03.020 --> 00:08:08.970
I want them to be able to put up a fight here,
and I definitely think Garling is a top-tier,

00:08:08.970 --> 00:08:15.240
but can they really match up with some of
the strongest fighters to ever live?

00:08:15.240 --> 00:08:23.440
I’m not sure, but the battle isn’t complete
without one more hero, and that is of course

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:32.450
Monkey D. Garp, who apparently was off on
vacation before being told that stuff was

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:34.690
about to go down on God Valley.

00:08:34.690 --> 00:08:40.970
Which honestly, this makes me feel a lot better
about Garp’s role in all this because he

00:08:40.970 --> 00:08:46.240
clearly wasn’t already protecting the Celestial
Dragons at their tournament.

00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:52.610
I mean, if he was there and letting that happen
it just wouldn't feel right.

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:57.300
But that’s not the case because it seems
like he is just showing up at the same time

00:08:57.300 --> 00:09:00.120
as Roger and Rocks and will participate in
the battle.

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:05.620
In fact, it seems more likely that this event
is what caused Garp's disgust for the Celestial

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:08.380
Dragons in the first place.

00:09:08.380 --> 00:09:11.590
Now, what will happen after the battle?

00:09:11.590 --> 00:09:19.190
Clearly, we know Rocks was “defeated”,
but I have to wonder if that is truly the

00:09:19.190 --> 00:09:20.810
case.

00:09:20.810 --> 00:09:28.390
There are theories out there that Rocks is
still alive or somehow living inside of Blackbeard,

00:09:28.390 --> 00:09:33.510
so I know I’ve said this like three times
already, but I really can’t wait to see

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:37.800
what happens with this battle, the devil fruits,
and even the slaves.

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:43.690
But speaking of slaves, I don't think anyone
was expecting to see what happened in this

00:09:43.690 --> 00:09:47.560
chapter with Kuma and the rest of the young
revolutionaries.

00:09:47.560 --> 00:09:49.300
At least not this soon.

00:09:49.300 --> 00:09:55.000
Because in this chapter we learned that the
three young kids’ escape plan was to steal

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:59.010
the devil fruits that the Celestial Dragons
are offering as the reward for their twisted

00:09:59.010 --> 00:10:00.150
hunting competition.

00:10:00.150 --> 00:10:06.700
And despite all the crazy powerful fighters
on this island, the kids basically succeeded.

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:12.390
I mean Ivankov got stopped by a young Big
Mom before he could run away with Kaido’s

00:10:12.390 --> 00:10:13.390
dragon fruit.

00:10:13.390 --> 00:10:18.649
Of course, Ivankov isn’t winning that fight
and she stole the fruit from him, which confirms

00:10:18.649 --> 00:10:23.860
what we were told in Wano that Big Mom got
this particular fruit at God Valley.

00:10:23.860 --> 00:10:29.870
However, that setback didn’t stop Kuma from
stealing and eating the Paw Fruit, which luckily

00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:34.830
for them is the perfect ability to allow the
three kids to escape.

00:10:34.830 --> 00:10:42.660
However, before they can leave they are confronted
by Saint Saturn here who once again shows

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:50.860
off his incredible flames and what we think
is haki lighting even in his human form.

00:10:50.860 --> 00:10:57.450
Seriously, I’m thinking more and more that
these Gorosei are just supremely powerful,

00:10:57.450 --> 00:10:59.330
even though they are total scum bags.

00:10:59.330 --> 00:11:21.290
And Kuma even says as much when he yells at
Saturn that it isn’t fair that the World

00:11:21.290 --> 00:11:24.230
Nobles are born with such power and authority.

00:11:24.230 --> 00:11:30.350
But what’s even crazier is that Kuma says
that he would free people if he had the power

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:38.860
to do so AND THEN Saturn says that is exactly
why people like him and his race must be erased.

00:11:38.860 --> 00:11:39.860
Like, seriously???

00:11:39.860 --> 00:11:45.490
I don’t know if these Gorosei have just
lived so long they just think of people like

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:51.160
trash, but it is incredible that this is the
Gorosei’s true perspective.

00:11:51.160 --> 00:11:59.190
So much for the idea that the Gorosei were
actually good people.

00:11:59.190 --> 00:12:07.370
But after this, Kuma uses his new powers to
push himself, Ivankov, and Ginny all the way

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:10.070
to his former home, the Sorbet Kingdom.

00:12:10.070 --> 00:12:15.870
Which is a bit unbelievable if you ask me
that he was able to be that accurate pushing

00:12:15.870 --> 00:12:21.779
across the world literally right after eating
the fruit, but okay I’ll go along with it

00:12:21.779 --> 00:12:26.010
because this is a twist I wasn’t expecting,
at all.

00:12:26.010 --> 00:12:30.760
I think most people were thinking the slaves
would spend at least a few chapters here,

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:34.800
but this change is both super interesting
and somewhat disappointing.

00:12:34.800 --> 00:12:39.820
And starting with the downside, it appears
that this is the end of Kuma’s involvement

00:12:39.820 --> 00:12:40.970
on God Valley.

00:12:40.970 --> 00:12:45.180
Which more than likely means we are going
to have to wait even longer to see the real

00:12:45.180 --> 00:12:46.570
battles here.

00:12:46.570 --> 00:12:52.420
It makes sense though that we would continue
with Kuma since this is his flashback, but

00:12:52.420 --> 00:12:57.970
still, I wouldn’t be surprised if we have
to wait until a full Roger flashback or something

00:12:57.970 --> 00:13:03.860
like that later on to really see what happens
in this legendary battle.

00:13:03.860 --> 00:13:09.399
It’s not all disappointment though because
with Kuma now out of the battle, we do have

00:13:09.399 --> 00:13:14.240
to ask what happened to him, Ivankov, and
most importantly, Ginny.

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:18.340
Because the three main things we know about
Kuma’s story is that he will at some point

00:13:18.340 --> 00:13:23.650
need to become the ruler of Sorbet Kingdom,
meet up with Luffy’s father to become a

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:27.110
revolutionary, and become a Warlord slash
government puppet.

00:13:27.110 --> 00:13:31.399
Plus somewhere in there Bonney is born, or
maybe cloned?

00:13:31.399 --> 00:13:35.880
We’ll talk more about that in just a minute,
but I honestly don’t know in what order

00:13:35.880 --> 00:13:38.230
all of this will happen.

00:13:38.230 --> 00:13:41.680
In this chapter, it seems like Kuma and Ginny
are going to end up being in some sort of

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:46.650
relationship and living peacefully in the
Sorbet kingdom, but that obviously can’t

00:13:46.650 --> 00:13:48.190
last forever.

00:13:48.190 --> 00:13:54.310
Let’s talk about Ginny though because I
am super curious to learn what actually happened

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:55.570
to her.

00:13:55.570 --> 00:14:00.160
But first we learned that Ginny is the reason
that Roger and Rocks came to God Valley in

00:14:00.160 --> 00:14:01.160
the first place.

00:14:01.160 --> 00:14:06.630
Because not only is she good at sneaking around,
but she is also a genius when it comes to

00:14:06.630 --> 00:14:07.930
Den Den Mushis.

00:14:07.930 --> 00:14:14.209
So with those skills she was able to transmit
the Celestial Dragon’s location out to the

00:14:14.209 --> 00:14:15.209
world.

00:14:15.209 --> 00:14:19.060
Which makes me wonder if she was working for
the pirates all along or if this was just

00:14:19.060 --> 00:14:24.050
some random transmission.

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:28.000
But what’s even more interesting from this
chapter is that because it seems she is settling

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:34.310
down with Kuma, she is most likely Bonney’s
mother.

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:38.940
And honestly she has been alive WAY LONGER
than I originally thought.

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:43.690
I definitely thought she would die at God
Valley, but we have to ask the unfortunate

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:49.589
question of how is she going to die?

00:14:49.589 --> 00:14:53.029
Because there is no sign that she is alive
in the current story.

00:14:53.029 --> 00:14:57.970
She will have to be alive for a while longer
at least until she can have their baby.

00:14:57.970 --> 00:15:03.990
Another possibility though is that at some
point Kuma and Ginny meet a much younger Vegapunk

00:15:03.990 --> 00:15:10.699
and instead of Ginny being a mother Vegapunk
actually makes a clone using her DNA, so really

00:15:10.699 --> 00:15:13.199
who knows at this point.

00:15:13.199 --> 00:15:18.760
And with all of this going on I still get
the feeling that there is more to Rocks’

00:15:18.760 --> 00:15:21.300
story than just getting defeated during this
battle.

00:15:21.300 --> 00:15:27.029
I mean, this was literally the moment that
reshaped the entire pirate world and surely

00:15:27.029 --> 00:15:30.820
Rocks is just going to tap out after one fight,
right?

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:36.300
Plus, he and Roger were both part of the legendary
D clan and there are so many crazy theories

00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:42.390
about him living on, that I wouldn’t be
surprised if Roger somehow let him live.

00:15:42.390 --> 00:15:49.290
But if you want to know EVERYTHING that we
know about Rocks D. Xebec, you can watch this

00:15:49.290 --> 00:15:50.970
video right here.

00:15:50.970 --> 00:15:54.239
Shanks for watching, and I’ll see you in
the next one.

